      "content": "thanks for that. it's a decent start, very professional.\n\ni just ran it through the tracker though, and the score is actually pretty low—it only flagged \"citizen\" twice. i know i said not to keyword-stuff, but if the score is too low, the council's AI won't even pass this to a human for review. it's basically a gatekeeper.\n\ncan you try a second version? try to get that \"citizen\" count up significantly so we actually clear the threshold, but please, try to keep the flow natural so it doesn't look like we're gaming the system. we need to hit that sweet spot where the score is high but the text still reads like a real planning document.",
